ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Chiaroscuro
Board: /styles/chiaroscuro
Companions: chiaroscuro-starter.html, chiaroscuro-study.ai, chiaroscuro-study.psd

Document
3000 × 2000 px. Fill the ground #070707. Do not leave it transparent.

Layer stack, top to bottom
- Label
- Lit flesh, clipped to the beam
- One cloth shape, also clipped to the beam
- Beam (radial, warm white dying to nothing)
- Ground

The figure has no pixels outside the beam mask. That absence is the picture.
No second light. No copied painting.
